                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>*o** teisá: kowmeh tein, tein kipia tayo:lo:t a, mm, chika:wakkowit, pos yeh mah wa:wa:kto ya</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a150" TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts157" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts158">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>no: seki t'sentilia sepa no: kalkowit, no: *lo mismo** t'sentilia kalkowit *lo que** tein, tein mehmelastik, *¡vaya!**.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
